{
  "id": "side_panel_horizontal",
  "name": "Side Panel (Horizontal)",
  "cardSizeId": "h86x54",
  "background": "@divAccent",
  "_comment": [
    "Modelled on the St John Samaritan and Tapasya references: a full-bleed",
    "coloured ground with a white body panel inset inside it, masthead across",
    "the top, photo left, LABEL : VALUE rows right.",
    "",
    "The coloured ground IS the card background, so the inset white panel reads",
    "as a border on all four sides. That is cheaper and more reliable in print",
    "than stroking a frame, and it survives a slightly off trim without showing",
    "a broken outline.",
    "",
    "The 38.1 mm photo is 71% of a 54 mm card height and cannot shrink, so the",
    "masthead is capped at 12 mm. That is the whole reason this layout is two",
    "columns rather than the stacked arrangement the vertical templates use:",
    "  masthead     0.0 -> 12.0  on the coloured ground",
    "  white body  12.0 -> 52.6",
    "  photo       13.2 -> 51.3  (38.1 mm - FIXED)",
    "  fields      19.2 -> 50.7  right column, 31.5 mm - roomy"
  ],
  "elements": [
    {
      "type": "logo",
      "x": 1.5, "y": 1.0, "w": 10, "h": 10
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "x": 13, "y": 0.9, "w": 52, "h": 5.6,
      "value": "{schoolName}",
      "size": 8.5,
      "bold": true,
      "color": "@white",
      "align": "left",
      "maxLines": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "x": 13, "y": 6.7, "w": 52, "h": 3.6,
      "value": "{addressLine}",
      "size": 4.2,
      "color": "@white",
      "align": "left",
      "maxLines": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "x": 66.5, "y": 1.6, "w": 17.5, "h": 8.4,
      "value": "{contactLine}",
      "size": 4.2,
      "color": "@white",
      "align": "right",
      "maxLines": 2
    },

    {
      "type": "rect",
      "x": 1.6, "y": 12.0, "w": 82.8, "h": 40.6,
      "fill": "@white",
      "radius": 1.6
    },

    {
      "type": "photo",
      "x": 4.0, "y": 13.2, "w": 30.48, "h": 38.1,
      "borderWidth": 0.35,
      "borderColor": "@divAccent"
    },

    {
      "type": "nameBanner",
      "x": 37, "y": 13.6, "w": 45, "h": 5.0,
      "size": 8,
      "color": "@primary",
      "align": "left"
    },
    {
      "type": "fields",
      "x": 37, "y": 19.2, "w": 45, "h": 31.5,
      "labelWidth": 14.5,
      "rowGap": 0.8,
      "showLabels": true,
      "exclude": ["name"]
    }
  ]
}
